cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AirCursor: A Touchless Pointer for the Web"
message: >-
  If you use AirCursor in a product, a publication, or any other work,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ishikawa
    given-names: Ritsuki
repository-code: "https://github.com/ritsuki-i/AirCursor"
url: "https://ritsuki-i.github.io/AirCursor/"
abstract: >-
  A browser library that turns webcam hand tracking into a full pointer:
  hover, click, right click, double click, drag and scroll, delivered as
  synthetic pointer events that ordinary web interfaces already understand.
keywords:
  - hand tracking
  - gesture control
  - touchless interface
  - human-computer interaction
  - mediapipe
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
